<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Rhodia-Ster started as sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Rhodia-Ster started as sell.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Friday it had started coverage of Brazilian petrochemical company Rhodia-Ster with a sell recommendation.</p>
<p>-- In a February 5 report, analysts Eric Graber-Lopez, Jay Bhutani and Phokion Potamianos wrote, &quot;Rhodia-Ster's shares currently trade at a sharp premium to the Brazilian market on almost all valuation measures.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 0.01 real to 0.36 real in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
